lass="title">参见</h3>  <ul class="simplelist">   <li><span class="methodname" style="color:#CC7832">{@link Uri\Rfc3986\Uri::getRawScheme()} - Retrieve the raw scheme component</span></li>   <li><span class="methodname" style="color:#CC7832">{@link Uri\Rfc3986\Uri::getScheme()} - Retrieve the normalized scheme component</span></li>   <li><span class="methodname" style="color:#CC7832">{@link Uri\WhatWg\Url::withScheme()} - Modify the scheme component</span></li>  </ul> </div></div>
