.basic">   <p><strong>示例 #1 <span class="methodname" style="color:#CC7832"><strong>Uri\Rfc3986\Uri::getUserInfo()</strong></span> basic example</strong></p>   <div class="example-contents"><div class="annotation-interactive phpcode" style="border-color:gray;background:#1E1F22;"><blockquote style="border:1px gray solid;white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="color: #000000"><span style="color: #9876AA">&lt;?php<br>\$uri </span><span style="color: #007700">= new </span><span style="color: #9876AA">\Uri\Rfc3986\Uri</span><span style="color: #007700">(</span><span style="color: #DD0000">"https://user:password@example.com"</span><span style="color: #007700">);<br><br>echo </span><span style="color: #9876AA">\$uri</span><span style="color: #007700">-&gt;</span><span style="color: #9876AA">getUserInfo</span><span style="color: #007700">();<br></span><span style="color: #9876AA">?&gt;</span></span></blockquote></div>   </div>   <div class="example-contents"><p>以上示例会输出：</p></div>   <div class="example-contents screen" style="border-color:gray;background:#1E1F22;"><div class="annotation-interactive examplescode"><blockquote style="border:1px gray solid;">user:password</blockquote></div>   </div>  </div> </div> <div class="refsect1 seealso" id="refsect1-uri-rfc3986-uri.getuserinfo-seealso">  <h3 class="title">参见</h3>  <ul class="simplelist">   <li><span class="methodname" style="color:#CC7832">{@link Uri\Rfc3986\Uri::getRawUserInfo()} - Retrieve the raw userinfo component</span></li>   <li><span class="methodname" style="color:#CC7832">{@link Uri\Rfc3986\Uri::getRawUsername()} - Retrieve the raw username</span></li>   <li><span class="methodname" style="color:#CC7832">{@link Uri\Rfc3986\Uri::getUsername()} - Retrieve the normalized username</span></li>   <li><span class="methodname" style="color:#CC7832">{@link Uri\Rfc3986\Uri::getRawPassword()} - Retrieve the raw password</span></li>   <li><span class="methodname" style="color:#CC7832">{@link Uri\Rfc3986\Uri::getPassword()} - Retrieve the normalized password</span></li>   <li><span class="methodname" style="color:#CC7832">{@link Uri\Rfc3986\Uri::withUserInfo()} - Modify the userinfo component</span></li>   <li><span class="methodname" style="color:#CC7832">{@link Uri\WhatWg\Url::getUsername()} - Retrieve the username component</span></li>   <li><span class="methodname" style="color:#CC7832">{@link Uri\WhatWg\Url::getPassword()} - Retrieve the password component</span></li>  </ul> </div></div>
