>equals</span><span style="color: #007700">(</span><span style="color: #9876AA">\$uri2</span><span style="color: #007700">));<br></span><span style="color: #9876AA">?&gt;</span></span></blockquote></div>   </div>   <div class="example-contents"><p>以上示例会输出：</p></div>   <div class="example-contents screen" style="border-color:gray;background:#1E1F22;"><div class="annotation-interactive examplescode"><blockquote style="border:1px gray solid;">bool(true)</blockquote></div>   </div>  </div> </div> <div class="refsect1 seealso" id="refsect1-uri-rfc3986-uri.equals-seealso">  <h3 class="title">参见</h3>  <ul class="simplelist">   <li><span class="methodname" style="color:#CC7832">{@link Uri\WhatWg\Url::equals()} - Check if two URLs are equivalent</span></li>  </ul> </div></div>
