 * <div id="uri-whatwg-url.parse" class="refentry"> <div class="refnamediv">  <h1 class="refname">Uri\WhatWg\Url::parse</h1>  <p class="verinfo">(PHP 8 &gt;= 8.5.0)</p><p class="refpurpose"><span class="refname">Uri\WhatWg\Url::parse</span> — <span class="dc-title">Parse a URL</span></p> </div> <div class="refsect1 description" id="refsect1-uri-whatwg-url.parse-description">  <h3 class="title">说明</h3>  <div class="methodsynopsis dc-description">   <span class="modifier">public</span> <span class="modifier">static</span> <span class="modifier">function</span> <span class="methodname" style="color:#CC7832"><strong>Uri\WhatWg\Url::parse</strong></span>(<span class="methodparam"><span class="type" style="color:#EAB766"><a href="https://php.net/manual/zh/language.types.string.php" class="type string" style="color:#EAB766">string</a></span> <span class="parameter" style="color:#3A95FF">\$uri</span></span>, <span class="methodparam"><span class="type" style="color:#EAB766"><span class="type" style="color:#EAB766"><a href="https://php.net/manual/zh/language.types.null.php" class="type null" style="color:#EAB766">?</a></span><span class="type" style="color:#EAB766"><a href="https://php.net/manual/zh/class.uri-whatwg-url.php" class="type Uri\WhatWg\Url" style="color:#EAB766">Uri\WhatWg\Url</a></span></span> <span class="parameter" style="color:#3A95FF">\$baseUrl</span><span class="initializer"> = <strong><span><a href="https://php.net/manual/zh/reserved.constants.php#constant.null">null</a></span></strong></span></span>, <span class="methodparam"><span class="type" style="color:#EAB766"><a href="https://php.net/manual/zh/language.types.array.php" class="type array" style="color:#EAB766">array</a></span> <span class="parameter reference" style="color:#3A95FF">&amp;\$errors</span><span class="initializer"> = <strong><span><a href="https://php.net/manual/zh/reserved.constants.php#constant.null">null</a></span></strong></span></span>): <span class="type" style="color:#EAB766"><span class="type" style="color:#EAB766"><a href="https://php.net/manual/zh/language.types.null.php" class="type null" style="color:#EAB766">?</a></span><span class="type" style="color:#EAB766">static</span></span></div>  <p class="simpara">   Parses a URL.  </p> </div> <div class="refsect1 parameters" id="refsect1-uri-whatwg-url.parse-parameters">  <h3 class="title">参数</h3>  <dl>       <dt><span class="parameter" style="color:#3A95FF">uri</span></dt>    <dd>     <span class="simpara">      A valid URL string to parse (e.g. <span class="literal">/foo</span> or (e.g. <span class="literal">https://example.com/foo</span>).     </span>    </dd>          <dt><span class="parameter" style="color:#3A95FF">baseUrl</span></dt>    <dd>     <span class="simpara">      When a <span class="type" style="color:#EAB766"><a href="https://php.net/manual/zh/language.types.string.php" class="type string" style="color:#EAB766">string</a></span> is passed, <span class="parameter" style="color:#3A95FF">uri</span> is applied on      <span class="parameter" style="color:#3A95FF">baseUrl</span>, if <span class="parameter" style="color:#3A95FF">uri</span> is a relative-URL string.      If either <strong><span><a href="https://php.net/manual/zh/reserved.constants.php#constant.null">null</a></span></strong> is passed, or <span class="parameter" style="color:#3A95FF">uri</span> is a not a relative-URL string, then      <span class="parameter" style="color:#3A95FF">baseUrl</span> doesn't have any effect.     </span>    </dd>          <dt><span class="parameter" style="color:#3A95FF">errors</span></dt>    <dd>     <span class="simpara">      An <span class="type" style="color:#EAB766"><a href="https://php.net/manual/zh/language.types.array.php" class="type array" style="color:#EAB766">array</a></span> to pass a list of <span class="classname"><a href="https://php.net/manual/zh/class.uri-whatwg-urlvalidationerror.php" class="classname">Uri\WhatWg\UrlValidationError</a></span>      instances by reference to provide extended information about the errors triggered during parsing.     </span>    </dd>     </dl> </div> <div class="refsect1 returnvalues" id="refsect1-uri-whatwg-url.parse-returnvalues">  <h3 class="title">返回值</h3>  <p class="simpara">   Returns a <span class="classname"><a href="https://php.net/manual/zh/class.uri-whatwg-url.php" class="classname">Uri\WhatWg\Url</a></span> instance on success, or <strong><span><a href="https://php.net/manual/zh/reserved.constants.php#constant.null">null</a></span></strong> on failure.  </p> </div> <div class="refsect1 examples" id="refsect1-uri-whatwg-url.parse-examples">  <h3 class="title">示例</h3>  <div class="example" id="uri-whatwg-url.parse.example.basic">   <p><strong>示例 #1 <span class="methodname" style="color:#CC7832"><strong>Uri\WhatWg\Url::parse()</strong></span> basic example</strong></p>   <div class="example-contents"><div class="annotation-interactive phpcode" style="border-color:gray;background:#1E1F22;"><blockquote style="border:1px gray solid;white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="color: #000000"><span style="color: #9876AA">&lt;?php<br>\$url </span><span style="color: #007700">= </span><span style="color: #9876AA">\Uri\WhatWg\Url</span><span style="color: #007700">::</span><span style="color: #9876AA">parse</span><span style="color: #007700">(</span><span style="color: #DD0000">"https://example.com"</span><span style="color: #007700">);<br><br>if (</span><span style="color: #9876AA">\$url </span><span style="color: #007700">!== </span><span style="color: #9876AA">null</span><span style="color: #007700">) {<br>    echo </span><span style="color: #DD0000">"Valid URL: " </span><span style="color: #007700">. </span><span style="color: #9876AA">\$url</span><span style="color: #007700">-&gt;</span><span style="color: #9876AA">toAsciiString</span><span style="color: #007700">();<br>} else {<br>    echo </span><span style="color: #DD0000">"Invalid URL"</span><span style="color: #007700">;<br>}<br></span><span style="color: #9876AA">?&gt;</span></span></blockquote></div>   </div>   <div class="example-contents"><p>以上示例会输出：</p></div>   <div class="example-contents screen" style="border-color:gray;background:#1E1F22;"><div class="annotation-interactive examplescode"><blockquote style="border:1px gray solid;">Valid&nbsp;URL:&nbsp;https://example.com</blockquote></div>   </div>  </div> </div> <div class="refsect1 seealso" id="refsect1-uri-whatwg-url.parse-seealso">  <h3 class="title">参见</h3>  <ul class="simplelist">   <li><span class="methodname" style="color:#CC7832">{@link Uri\WhatWg\Url::__construct()} - Construct the Url object</span></li>   <li><span class="methodname" style="color:#CC7832">{@link Uri\WhatWg\Url::resolve()} - Resolve a URL with the current object as the base URL</span></li>   <li><span class="methodname" style="color:#CC7832">{@link Uri\Rfc3986\Uri::parse()} - Parse a URI</span></li>  </ul> </div></div>
 */
