whatwg-url.withfragment-seealso">  <h3 class="title">参见</h3>  <ul class="simplelist">   <li><span class="methodname" style="color:#CC7832">{@link Uri\WhatWg\Url::getFragment()} - Retrieve the fragment component</span></li>   <li><span class="methodname" style="color:#CC7832">{@link Uri\Rfc3986\Uri::withFragment()} - Modify the fragment component</span></li>  </ul> </div></div>
